[0.666, "o", "\u001b[H\n\n\n\n\n\nThe `run_in_shell` tool has an average overhead of              \r\napproximately **5 milliseconds per call** when executed in      \r\nparallel. This overhead includes:                               \r\n- Shell process spawning                                        \r\n- Command execution infrastructure                              \r\n- Result serialization and return                               \r\n                                                                \r\nThis is quite efficient for a tool that provides isolated       \r\nshell execution with full stdout/stderr capture and exit        \r\n\u001b[38;5;62m╭─────╮\u001b[0m                                                         \r\n\u001b[38;5;62m│\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;230;48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;230;48;5;62m:help\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;62m│\u001b[0m                                                         \r\n\u001b[38;5;62m╰─────╯\u001b[0m                                                         \r\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[97m:h\u001b[7m \u001b[0m\u001b[0m                                                             \u001b["]
